      "id": "claim_536958a92842448182328e4f4b4ba08f",
      "statement": "Only apps/api ever runs as a process: in production one Node 24 container executes node apps/api/dist/main.js and serves both the built Vite SPA and /api/*; apps/web exists as a source tree built into static assets served by that container.",
