    {
      "id": "claim_700a0535d8824d5ba78d17428cc481fc",
      "statement": "In development the two workspaces run as separate processes joined by an HTTP proxy: the Vite dev server binds 127.0.0.1:5173 and proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:3000, where the API (nest start --watch) listens. Both processes must be up for the browser to reach the API.",
