      "statement": "The root dev scripts scope turbo to a single workspace — pnpm dev:web is `turbo run dev --filter=@mota/web` and pnpm dev:api is `turbo run dev --filter=@mota/api` — and the turbo `dev` task is persistent, uncached, and depends on `^build`, so the shared packages are compiled once before either watcher starts.",
