      "statement": "The API needs the `mota` PostgreSQL database managed by ../home-server-infra: the README instructs copying .env.example to .env and setting the password for the dedicated `mota` role, and .env.example points local development at 127.0.0.1:15432 with database and user `mota` (while the API env schema defaults to host `home-server-pg`, port 5432).",
