    {
      "id": "claim_28de71493c5c4367b9e760d21fec7163",
      "statement": "pnpm test:integration is deliberately uncached and gated: turbo declares the task `cache: false` with `env: [\"DATABASE_URL\"]`, and both integration suites (apps/api's settings.postgres.integration.test.ts and @mota/db's repository.integration.test.ts) wrap their entire body in `describe.runIf(Boolean(process.env.DATABASE_URL))`. Without DATABASE_URL exported the task is a silent no-op that still passes, so a green run is not proof the database layer executed.",
