      "statement": "pnpm db:generate, db:migrate, and db:studio bypass turbo and target the @mota/db workspace directly via `pnpm --filter` (drizzle-kit generate, tsx src/migrate.ts, drizzle-kit studio); both drizzle.config.ts and src/migrate.ts refuse to run without DATABASE_URL, and the migrate script applies the SQL in ./drizzle to the database. Boot-time migrations in main.ts mean db:migrate is for local schema work, not a deploy prerequisite.",
