    {
      "id": "claim_92cb6d1959d64aa6b85763a2f24793d7",
      "statement": "Production Compose does not read the repo .env: it is started with `docker compose --env-file ../home-server-infra/.env up -d --build`, and SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, and DATABASE_PASSWORD (from POSTGRES_PASSWORD) use `${VAR:?...}` interpolation so a missing value aborts `docker compose up` with a clear message instead of starting a container that would immediately crash. The service is published at 127.0.0.1:3100 and joins the external cloudflare-tunnel and home-server networks.",
