      "statement": "The AGENTS.md boundaries decide where a change lands: packages/contracts imports only Zod and its own modules; packages/db imports contracts and Drizzle and never Nest or React; the two apps never import each other and meet only at HTTP; identity is the Supabase `sub` claim with no local user record; and transit rows are limited to three only at the presentation boundary (adapters and schemas must not truncate).",
